{
  "name": "complete_work",
  "description": "Declare the current work result explicitly. Text is at most 100000 characters; at most 20 safe HTTP(S) links without userinfo. No files or paths. A declaration ends this native turn; the Host separately verifies durable facts and drains resources before any task submission. Do not request more work or tools after this declaration.",
